{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Inner Tempo 是為 iPhone 與 Apple Watch 而設的呼吸練習應用，內建 11 種以科學研究為基礎的呼吸法，配合全螢幕發光節奏指引，所有紀錄只留在你的裝置之上，無需帳戶、不含訂閱與廣告。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-3.webp\">\n<h2>十一種科學呼吸法全螢幕引導</h2>\n<p>全螢幕發光指引會帶動每次吸氣、閉氣與呼氣，可切換三種呼吸動畫，亦可選用語音、環境音或觸感回饋，或靜音跟隨畫面。練習會累積連續日數與 14 天穩定度分數，完成的時段寫入 Apple Health 正念分鐘，Apple Watch 亦可獨立操作並自動同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-252-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-253-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-254-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-255-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-256-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-257-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Inner Tempo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.934635+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T23:21:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:08.676773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:15.390797+00:00","content_hash":"4f38a2948a9186eb485cb833839fd1a3af3a6c14cd0a39159465ed775431d8eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}